comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T16:19:51.157Z","harness:codex","GitHub report linkage: GH-749 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/749. Created only after an all-status duplicate search and full metadata review of the closest SDK/importer/exporter lineage."
body: "GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/749\n\nScope is the missing execution-context injection and its public testing/documentation contract. Registration metadata and name-based test invocation are already shipped; do not duplicate those surfaces."
